		[Electricity Timeslice])
	+ SUM(BAU Last Year Hybrid Grid Battery Storage Capacity[Electricity Source!])
	+ BAU This Year Cumulative Policy Mandated Grid Battery Storage * (1 - UFDfGBS Usage Factor Discount for Grid Battery Storage\
		[Electricity Timeslice])
	~	MW*hour
	~		|

BAU Last Year Grid and Hybrid Battery Storage Available in MW[Electricity Timeslice]=
