		Start Year Grid Battery Storage Capacity in MWh)
	~	MW*hour
	~		|

BAU Last Year Grid Battery Storage Capacity Including Hybrid Batteries=
	SUM(BAU Last Year Hybrid Grid Battery Storage Capacity[Electricity Source!])
