		]-BAU CCS Subsidy Payments per Unit Electricity Output Expiring After Subsidy Duration Period\
		[Electricity Source])/One Year,
		0)
	~	$
	~		|

BAU Last Year Subsidies Paid per Unit Electricity Output for Newly Eligible Generation Capacity\
		[Electricity Source]= INTEG (
	(BAU Subsidies Paid per Unit Electricity Output for Newly Eligible Generation Capacity\
		[Electricity Source]-BAU Subsidy Payments per Unit Electricity Output Expiring After Subsidy Duration Period\
		[Electricity Source])/One Year,
