		plus imported clinker over cement production, with imported finished \
		cement assumed to carry the same ratio. Converts cement demand into \
		clinker demand. The clinker-substitution lever lowers it toward MACtCR in \
		the policy case. US: USGS data for 2021-2025 (0.892 falling to 0.829 as \
		Type IL cement spreads), then a product-mix projection (USGS cement \
		shipments by type x PCA clinker contents, scaled to 2025): 0.820 in 2030, \
		0.813 in 2035, 0.809 in 2050.
