Below Standard Clinker Capacity Forced to Decide by Pathway[Cement Production Pathway\
		]=
	Fraction of Below Standard Clinker Capacity Forced to Decide Each Year This Year
	* Last Year Below Standard Preexisting Clinker Capacity by Pathway[Cement Production Pathway\
		]
	~	metric tons/Year
	~	Below-standard kiln capacity the performance standard forces to its \
		overhaul-or-retire decision this year, ahead of its campaign end: the \
		lever share of the undecided below-standard pool. Added to the capacity \
		facing a decision.
	|

Below Standard Preexisting Clinker Capacity Decided This Year by Pathway[Cement Production Pathway\
		]=
	MIN(
	  Last Year Below Standard Preexisting Clinker Capacity by Pathway[Cement Production Pathway\
		],
	  Below Standard Clinker Capacity Forced to Decide by Pathway[Cement Production Pathway\
		]
	  + ZIDZ(Last Year Below Standard Preexisting Clinker Capacity by Pathway[Cement Production Pathway\
		],
	         Last Year Preexisting Clinker Production Capacity by Pathway[Cement Production Pathway\
		])
	    * MIN(
	        Last Year Preexisting Clinker Production Capacity by Pathway[Cement Production Pathway\
		],
	        CPRS Cement Preexisting Capacity Overhaul Decision Schedule[Cement Production Pathway\
		]
	        + Preexisting Clinker Capacity Reentering Decision Pool by Pathway[Cement Production Pathway\
		]
	      )
	)
	~	metric tons/Year
	~	Below-standard capacity leaving the undecided pool this year: the forced \
		amount plus the pool's share of the ordinary campaign-end decisions (the \
		schedule and re-entering overhauls, taken pro rata to the below-standard \
		share of the surviving start-year fleet), capped by the pool itself.
	|

