	~	This switch replaces the BAU RPS or CES percentage schedule (read from the \
		BRPSDbS input file) with the non-BAU schedule read from the RPSDbS input \
		file.  Year-by-year phasing lives in the RPSDbS file itself.  The RPS and \
		CES percentage policy levers still apply on top of the substituted \
		schedule via MAX.
