CCTS Cement CCfD Two Sided Share=
	GET DIRECT CONSTANTS(
	   'InputData/indst/_cement/CCTS/CCTS.csv',
	   ',',
	   'B2'
	)
	~	Dmnl [0,1]
	~	Share of cement carbon contracts for difference that are two-sided: when \
		the carbon price rises above the strike price, a two-sided contract pays \
		the excess back to government; a one-sided contract stops paying but owes \
		nothing. 1 = all two-sided (Germany's climate protection contracts), 0 = \
		all one-sided (the Netherlands' SDE++ and Denmark's carbon capture \
		tenders). It only matters in years when the carbon price exceeds the \
		strike. See the About tab of the workbook in its folder.
	|

