Change in Baseline Energy Costs[All Fuels] :EXCEPT: [electricity]=
	IF THEN ELSE(
	  BAEPAbCiPC Boolean Are Energy Prices Affected by Changes in Production Costs[All Fuels\
		] > 0,
	
	  Last Year Change in Energy Supplier Cost per Unit Fuel Produced[All Fuels]
	  * (1 - Toggle Whether Policies Affect Energy Prices This Year[All Fuels]),
	
	  Last Year Change in Energy Supplier Cost per Unit Fuel Produced[All Fuels]
	  * Toggle Whether Policies Affect Energy Prices This Year[All Fuels]
	) ~~|
Change in Baseline Energy Costs[electricity]=
	0
	~	$/BTU
	~		|

Change in BAU Energy Imports vs Initial Year[All Fuels]=
