Change in Carbon Tax Rebates to Nonenergy Industries[energy industries within industry category\
		]=
	0
	~	$
	~	Carbon tax rebates excluding those accruing to the energy industry \
		categories (coal mining, oil and gas extraction, refining, pipelines), \
		whose rebates belong to the coal suppliers and natural gas and petroleum \
		suppliers entities (see Other Changes in Industry Sector Tax and Tax \
		Rebate Revenues). Used in the nonenergy industry revenue by ISIC Code \
		roll-up and its transfer-payments IO offset, which must use the same \
		basis, so that the nonenergy revenue totals match the nonenergy industries \
		entity and Check for Equality of Industry Sector Nonenergy Industry \
		Revenue holds. Masking mirrors Change in Carbon Tax Rebate on Exported \
		Nonenergy Products.
	|

Change in Carbon Tax Revenue=
