	)
	~	Dmnl
	~	Armington elasticity of substitution between imported and domestic cement: \
		how strongly the import share responds to a change in the relative import \
		price. US default 2 (range 1.5 to 3: GTAP non-metallic minerals 2.9, \
		Fowlie-Reguant-Ryan import supply 2.5, Monjon-Quirion cement 1.5 to 3). \
		See the About tab of the workbook in its folder.
	|

