CKFSR Cement Kiln Fuel Shift Recipient Fractions[Source Industrial Fuel,Target Industrial Fuel\
		]=
	GET DIRECT CONSTANTS(
	   'InputData/indst/_cement/CKFSR/CKFSR.csv',
	   ',',
	   'B2*'
	)
	~	Dmnl
	~	For each fossil kiln fuel (source), the fraction of the energy the kiln \
		fuel shift lever takes from it that goes to each replacing fuel (target), \
		in the same source-to-target form as the hydrogen pathway shifting (BRHPF) \
		and feedstock shifting (IFSRF) tables. Each fossil source sums to one; a \
		fuel can be sent to itself (natural gas to natural gas) to leave it \
		unchanged. Alternative fuels ride the biomass target, priced at the \
		biomass price. US values send every fossil fuel to biomass (alternative \
		fuels). See the About tab of the workbook in its folder.
	|

