Est Start Year Transportation Sector Fuel Used[Vehicle Type,Cargo Type,Vehicle Technology\
		,Transportation Fuel]=
	IF THEN ELSE(Start Year Fleet Avg Fuel Economy[Vehicle Type,Cargo Type,Vehicle Technology\
		] * SYAVLo Start Year Average Vehicle Loading[Cargo Type,Vehicle Type] > 0, (Start Year Cargo Dist Transported\
		[Vehicle Type,Cargo Type,Vehicle Technology]) / (Start Year Fleet Avg Fuel Economy[\
		Vehicle Type,Cargo Type,Vehicle Technology] * SYAVLo Start Year Average Vehicle Loading\
		[Cargo Type,Vehicle Type]), 0)
	* BPoEFUbVT BAU Perc of Each Fuel Used by Veh Technology[Vehicle Type,Cargo Type,Vehicle Technology\
		,Transportation Fuel]
	~	BTU
	~		|

ESTRTE Grid Battery Round Trip Efficiency=
