Fossil Kiln Energy per Ton of Clinker by Pathway and Fuel[Cement Production Pathway,Industrial Fuel\
		]=
	Cement Energy Intensity by Pathway and Fuel This Year[Cement Production Pathway,Industrial Fuel\
		]
	* Cement Kiln Fossil Fuel Flag[Industrial Fuel]
	~	BTU/metric ton
	~	Fossil thermal energy per ton of clinker by pathway and fuel before any \
		shift: the fleet-basis intensity of the fossil kiln fuels, zero for \
		electricity, the biomass element and fuels the kilns do not burn. The pool \
		the kiln fuel shift lever draws from.
	|

