Fraction of Industrial Combustion Fuel Use Avoided by Efficiency Measures[Industry Category\
		]=
	MIN(1,
	  SUM(PEMFSP Process Efficiency Measure Fuel Savings Potential[Industry Category,Process Efficiency Measure\
		!]
	    * MCLS Measure Cost Level Share[Measure Cost Level!]
	    * Deployed Fraction of Process Efficiency Measure Potential[Industry Category,Process Efficiency Measure\
		!,Measure Cost Level!])
	)
	~	Dmnl
	~	Deployed process efficiency measure fuel savings as a fraction of the \
		industry's total combustion fuel use.  Capped at 1 so energy use cannot go \
		negative under future data revisions.
	|

Fraction of Industrial Electricity Use Avoided by Efficiency Measures[Industry Category\
		]=
	MIN(1,
	  SUM(PEMESP Process Efficiency Measure Elec Savings Potential[Industry Category,Process Efficiency Measure\
		!]
	    * MCLS Measure Cost Level Share[Measure Cost Level!]
	    * Deployed Fraction of Process Efficiency Measure Potential[Industry Category,Process Efficiency Measure\
		!,Measure Cost Level!])
	)
	~	Dmnl
	~	Deployed process efficiency measure electricity savings as a fraction of \
		the industry's total electricity use.  Capped at 1 so energy use cannot go \
		negative under future data revisions.
	|

Fraction of Industrial Heat Electricity Use Avoided by Waste Heat Measures[Industry Category\
		]=
	MIN(1,
	  Waste Heat Availability Index[Industry Category]
	  * SUM(WHMESP Waste Heat Measure Elec Savings Potential[Industry Category,Waste Heat Measure\
		!]
	    * MCLS Measure Cost Level Share[Measure Cost Level!]
	    * Deployed Fraction of Waste Heat Measure Potential[Industry Category,Waste Heat Measure\
		!,Measure Cost Level!])
	)
	~	Dmnl
	~	Deployed waste heat measure electricity savings as a fraction of the \
		industry's heating-process electricity use, scaled by the waste heat \
		availability index.  Capped at 1 so energy use cannot go negative under \
		future data revisions.
	|

Fraction of Industrial Heat Fuel Use Avoided by Waste Heat Measures[Industry Category\
		]=
	MIN(1,
	  Waste Heat Availability Index[Industry Category]
	  * SUM(WHMFSP Waste Heat Measure Fuel Savings Potential[Industry Category,Waste Heat Measure\
		!]
	    * MCLS Measure Cost Level Share[Measure Cost Level!]
	    * Deployed Fraction of Waste Heat Measure Potential[Industry Category,Waste Heat Measure\
		!,Measure Cost Level!])
	)
	~	Dmnl
	~	Deployed waste heat measure fuel savings as a fraction of the industry's \
		heating-process combustion fuel use, scaled by the waste heat availability \
		index.  Capped at 1 so energy use cannot go negative under future data \
		revisions.
	|

