Government Interest Spread Payments for Industrial Equipment=
	(SoFSbI Share of Financing Support by Instrument[interest buydown]
	 + SoFSbI Share of Financing Support by Instrument[green bank])
	* SUM(Interest Rate Subsidy Value for Industrial Equipment[Industry Category!])
	~	$
	~	Annual government payments covering the interest spread on the buydown and \
		green bank shares of qualifying loans: the difference between what \
		industry would repay this year at the unsubsidized rate and what it \
		actually repays at the lever-reduced rate.  Paid each year over each loan \
		cohort's repayment period, matching this model's annual cash flow \
		architecture (real budgets typically appropriate the equivalent net \
		present value upfront under FCRA).  Green bank concessionality is treated \
		identically to a buydown here - the below-market spread IS the annual \
		cost; capitalization, lending capacity limits, and capital recycling await \
		a revolving-fund structure.
	|

Government Revenue Change Allocated by Mechanism[Government Revenue Mechanism]=
	QUANTUM(
	  SUM(
	    Change in Government Cash Flow by Cash Flow Type[Govt Cash Flow Type!]
	    * Percent of Government Cash Flow Change Allocated by Mechanism[Govt Cash Flow Type\
		!,Government Revenue Mechanism]
	  ),
	
	  QSfCF Quantization Size for Cash Flows
	)
	~	$
	~		|

Government Revenue Change Allocated to Private Businesses by ISIC Code[ISIC Code]=
	Government Revenue Change Allocated by Mechanism[payroll taxes]
	* Percent of Payroll Tax Allocation by ISIC Code[ISIC Code]
	
	+ Government Revenue Change Allocated by Mechanism[corporate taxes]
	* Percent of Corporate Income Tax Allocation by ISIC Code[ISIC Code]
	~	$
	~		|

Government Revenue Mechanism:
	regular spending,
	deficit spending,
	household taxes,
	payroll taxes,
	corporate taxes
	~	
	~		|

Govt Cash Flow Type:
	carbon tax revenue,
	fuel tax revenue,
	EV subsidy,
	battery production subsidy,
	elec gen subsidy,
	elec cap construction subsidy,
	distributed solar subsidy,
	fuel subsidy,
	CCS subsidy,
	indst clean heat subsidy,
	indst efficiency subsidy,
	indst proc emis subsidy,
	indst financing support,
	hydgn production subsidy,
	indst clean materials support,
	national debt interest,
	remainder
	~	
	~		|

