HRPfIEP Hurdle Rate Premium for Industrial Equipment Purchases=
	GET DIRECT CONSTANTS(
	   'InputData/indst/HRPfIEP/HRPfIEP.csv',
	   ',',
	   'B2'
	)
	~	Dmnl
	~	Behavioral hurdle-rate premium added to BCoISC (industry WACC) when \
		discounting future fuel costs, fuel taxes, carbon taxes, and the clean \
		heat subsidy in the industrial equipment fuel choice - a decision \
		parameter only; actual financing cash flows continue to use BCoISC \
		unchanged.  Capital costs deliberately exclude the premium: they enter the \
		choice at roughly sticker price, and the behavioral content of a hurdle \
		rate is the asymmetry between fully felt upfront cost and heavily \
		discounted future savings.  Central value 0.1552 = 20 percent target \
		decision hurdle rate minus mean industry WACC, anchored on NEMS industrial \
		payback acceptance (
	|

