Kiln Energy Shifted Away per Ton of Clinker by Pathway and Fuel[Cement Production Pathway\
		,Industrial Fuel]=
	Fraction of Fossil Kiln Energy Shifted This Year
	* Fossil Kiln Energy per Ton of Clinker by Pathway and Fuel[Cement Production Pathway\
		,Industrial Fuel]
	~	BTU/metric ton
	~	Energy per ton of clinker the kiln fuel shift lever takes from each fossil \
		fuel this year (the lever times the fuel's use; each fossil source in \
		CKFSR sends all of it somewhere). Subtracted from the pre-shift intensity.
	|

Kiln Energy Shifted In per Ton of Clinker by Pathway and Fuel[Cement Production Pathway\
		,Target Industrial Fuel]=
	SUM(
	  Fraction of Fossil Kiln Energy Shifted This Year
	  * Fossil Kiln Energy per Ton of Clinker by Pathway and Fuel[Cement Production Pathway\
		,Source Industrial Fuel!]
	  * CKFSR Cement Kiln Fuel Shift Recipient Fractions[Source Industrial Fuel!,Target Industrial Fuel\
		]
	)
	~	BTU/metric ton
	~	Energy per ton of clinker arriving at each replacing fuel this year: the \
		energy shifted away from every fossil source times the fraction CKFSR \
		sends to this target. Added to that fuel in the post-shift intensity.
	|

