Last Year Carbon Tax Effects on Expenditures by Nonenergy Industries As Share of Nonenergy Industry Output\
		[Industry Category]=
	DELAY FIXED(
	  Carbon Tax Effects on Expenditures by Nonenergy Industries As Share of Nonenergy Industry Output\
		[Industry Category],
	  1,
	  0
	)
	~	Dmnl
	~	One-year delay of the carbon tax cost share.  Carbon tax levied depends on \
		current-year industrial fuel use, which depends on Percent Change in \
		Production due to Policies; lagging the carbon tax term here (rather than \
		lagging the entire production response to passthrough expenses) breaks \
		that simultaneity while letting the smoothed passthrough cost signal \
		affect production, imports, and exports in the same year.  Net carbon tax \
		timing to production is unchanged from the original structure.
	|

