	~	metric tons/Year
	~	LEVEL: clinker production capacity built during the model run, at the \
		beginning of the year: new builds flow in, campaign-end retirements flow \
		out (no CPAL age decay since the Q4 decision-curve change). This year's \
		available value is Clinker Production Capacity Added During Model Run by \
		Pathway. Renamed 2026-09-29 to the standard Last Year level convention.
