		]
	+ Last Year Clinker Production Capacity Added During Model Run by Pathway[Cement Production Pathway\
		]
	~	metric tons/Year
	~	Beginning-of-year clinker nameplate: the two levels summed before this \
		year's decisions and builds. Read by the decision chain (fleet \
		utilization, tightness, headroom, marginal operating cost) and the \
		unmet-need trigger, which must not depend on this year's retirements. This \
		year's available capacity is Clinker Production Capacity by Pathway. \
		Renamed 2026-09-29 from Clinker Production Capacity by Pathway when the \
		level/this-year split was made explicit.
