		the new-build baseline), accumulating RAW incremental demand rather than \
		the quantized capacity round-trip the hydrogen chain uses: this chain \
		builds only onshore wind and solar PV, whose small plant quantum makes the \
		quantization ledger overbuilt (simplified 2026-08-17 per Dan O'Brien). The \
		capacity stock keeps its QUANTUM for capex purposes; any \
		ledger-vs-capacity mismatch is bounded at one quantum per build event and \
		does not compound.
