Last Year Thermal Battery Grid Delivery Cost per Unit Electricity=
	DELAY FIXED(
	  Thermal Battery Grid Delivery Cost per Unit Electricity, 1, 0
	)
	~	$/BTU
	~	One year lag, matching the lagged marginal cost term in Grid Connected \
		Thermal Battery Electricity Cost per Unit Energy and avoiding a same year \
		loop through the electricity sector cost stack (CES costs depend on \
		dispatch, which sees thermal battery charging load). Initialized to zero: \
		the adder depends on total demand, which includes thermal battery grid \
		charging, so a self-referencing initial value would be circular at INITIAL \
		TIME. The year one price therefore omits the adder, matching the year one \
		charging window convention; harmless under calibration respecting ramps.
