MACtCR Minimum Achievable Clinker to Cement Ratio=
	GET DIRECT CONSTANTS(
	   'InputData/indst/_cement/MACtCR/MACtCR.csv',
	   ',',
	   'B2*'
	)
	~	Dmnl
	~	The clinker-to-cement ratio reachable at full deployment of the \
		clinker-substitution lever (aggressive SCM blending: calcined clay/LC3, \
		slag cement, expanded blended-cement specs). The lever's potential each \
		year is the gap between the BAU ratio (BCtCR) and this floor, capped by \
		the SCM supply ramp (CSPAbY), so the same lever definition works where the \
		BAU ratio differs. It counts SCMs wherever they are blended (in the cement \
		or at the concrete plant); mix optimization belongs to the separate \
		cement-content lever. SCM supply limits are reflected in the value chosen. \
		US: 0.65 (judgment informed by PCA and GCCA roadmaps).
	|

