Mileage Weighted Last Year Vehicles[Vehicle Type,Cargo Type,Vehicle Technology]=
	SUM(Last Year Vehicles by Vintage[Vehicle Type,Cargo Type,Vehicle Technology,Vehicle Vintage\
		!] * Vehicle Relative Annual Mileage by Vintage[Cargo Type,Vehicle Type,Vehicle Vintage\
		!])
	~	vehicles
