	   ',',
	   'B2*'
	)
	~	MW
	~	These maximums reflect the available resource potential for hydro, wind, \
		solar, and biomass power.  Maximums for coal, natural gas, and nuclear are \
		not imposed, as these power types are unlikely to be geographically \
		resource-constrained.  (An arbitrarily high number is chosen here, to \
		ensure this limit doesn't come into play for these three electricity \
		sources.)
	|

