Non BAU Weighted Average Elec Portfolio Percentage by Year[Future Year,RPS]=
	MIN(
	  1,

	  SUM(
	    RPSDbS RPS Percentages by Subregion[Subregion!,Future Year]
	    * BRPSDbS BAU Electricity Shares by Subregion[Subregion!]
	  )
	 ) ~~|
Non BAU Weighted Average Elec Portfolio Percentage by Year[Future Year,CES]=
	MIN(
	  1,

	  SUM(
	    RPSDbS CES Percentages by Subregion[Subregion!,Future Year]
	    * BRPSDbS BAU Electricity Shares by Subregion[Subregion!]
	  )
	 )
	~	Dmnl
	~	Weighted average non-BAU RPS and CES percentage schedules.  Substituted \
		for the BAU schedules in Weighted Average Elec Portfolio Percentage by \
		Year when Boolean Use Non BAU Elec Portfolio Settings is enabled.  Uses \
		the BAU electricity shares as subregion weights because those weights are \
		a property of the region, not of the policy schedule.
	|

