Off Grid Capacity for Green Hydrogen Demand[Electricity Source]=
	New Off Grid Capacity for Green Hydrogen Demand[Electricity Source]
	+ Last Year Cumulative Off Grid Capacity for Green Hydrogen Demand[Electricity Source\
		]
	~	MW
	~		|

Off Grid Electricity Capacity Serving Thermal Batteries[Electricity Source]=
	New Off Grid Electricity Capacity Serving Thermal Batteries[Electricity Source]
	+ Last Year Off Grid Electricity Capacity Serving Thermal Batteries[Electricity Source\
		]
	- Retired Off Grid Electricity Capacity Serving Thermal Batteries[Electricity Source\
		]
	~	MW
	~	Cumulative dedicated renewable capacity built to charge industrial thermal \
		batteries. Tracked outside the electricity sector fleet, exactly as Off \
		Grid Capacity for Green Hydrogen Demand is.
	|

Off Grid Electricity Demand for Green Hydrogen by Power Plant Type[Electricity Source\
		]=
	Off Grid Electricity Demand for Green Hydrogen That is New This Year by Power Plant Type With Quantization\
		[Electricity Source]
	+ Last Year Cumulative Off Grid Electricity Demand for Green Hydrogen by Power Plant Type\
		[Electricity Source]
	~	MW*hr
	~		|

Off Grid Electricity Demand for Green Hydrogen That is New This Year by Power Plant Type\
		[Electricity Source]=
	Share of Off Grid Electricity Demand That is New This Year Met by Power Plant Type[Electricity Source\
		]
	
	* Hydrogen Sector Off Grid Electricity Demand for Green Hydrogen That is New This Year
	~	MW*hr
	~		|

Off Grid Electricity Demand for Green Hydrogen That is New This Year by Power Plant Type With Quantization\
		[Electricity Source]=
	New Off Grid Capacity for Green Hydrogen Demand[Electricity Source]
	* Expected Capacity Factor x Hours per Year for Plants Built This Year Without Hypothetical Calculations\
		[Electricity Source]
	~	MW*hr
	~		|

Off Grid Thermal Battery Electricity Cost per Unit Energy=
	SUM(Cost per Unit New Elec Output Using Expected Capacity Factors[Electricity Source\
		!]
	  * Share of Off Grid Electricity Demand That is New This Year Met by Power Plant Type\
		[Electricity Source!])
	* MWh per BTU

	+
	SUM(
	  ZIDZ(Share of Off Grid Electricity Demand That is New This Year Met by Power Plant Type\
		[Electricity Source!],
	  Expected Capacity Factor x Hours per Year for Plants Built This Year[Electricity Source\
		!])
	)
	* TCCpUNEC Transmission Construction Cost per Unit New Electricity Capacity
	* MWh per BTU
	~	$/BTU
	~	Levelized cost of dedicated off-grid electricity for thermal battery \
		charging: new-build electricity cost blended across eligible power plant \
		types, plus the transmission construction cost adder, mirroring the \
		electrolysis with guaranteed clean electricity pathway in Cost per Unit \
		New Hydrogen Production before CCS.
	|

