	    Infant Deaths by Demographic Trait[sex!]
	    - BDbDT BAU Infant Deaths by Demographic Trait[sex!]
	  ),
	
	  SUM(BDbDT BAU Infant Deaths by Demographic Trait[sex!])
	)
	~	Dmnl
	~		|

