RnD Cement Pathway Capital Cost Perc Reduction[Cement Production Pathway]=
	0,	{dry kiln with precalciner}
	0,	{dry kiln with CCS}
	0,	{electric kiln}
	0,	{electric kiln with CCS}
	0	{alternative chemistry cement}
	~	Dmnl [0,0.4]
	~	Policy lever (cement pathway R&D): the fractional reduction in the kiln \
		capital cost of each clinker production pathway from research and \
		development, at full implementation. Applies to greenfield kiln capital \
		(and so to the levelized cost that drives the pathway choice, the capital \
		booking and the financing) and to kiln overhaul capital. On the CCS \
		pathway it reduces the kiln only; the capture equipment is reduced by RnD \
		CCS Capital Cost Perc Reduction, so the two levers do not overlap. Rides \
		the RnD cement pathway capital cost reduction implementation schedule (the \
		same S-shaped ramp as the other industry R&D levers). Added 2026-10-14, \
		replacing the mapping of the industry R&D lever onto the pathways.
	|

RnD Cement Pathway Capital Cost Perc Reduction This Year[Cement Production Pathway]=
	RnD Cement Pathway Capital Cost Perc Reduction[Cement Production Pathway]
	* VECTOR ELM MAP(
	    Selected Policy Implementation Schedule[RnD cement pathway capital cost reduction X dry kiln with precalciner\
		],
	    (Cement Production Pathway-1)
	  )
	~	Dmnl
	~	The cement pathway R&D kiln capital cost reduction as implemented this \
		year, on the RnD cement pathway capital cost reduction implementation \
		schedule (one element per pathway). Policy case only; the BAU kiln capital \
		costs keep CPCaOC.
	|

