	   'B2*'
	)
	~	BTU/metric ton
	~	Thermal energy required to produce one metric ton of the marginal \
		supplementary cementitious material displacing clinker under the \
		substitution lever, booked to natural gas. US: 1,242,825 BTU per ton for a \
		marginal mix of 50 percent calcined clay (2.3 GJ/t), 15 percent limestone, \
		15 percent fly ash (mostly harvested, dried), 15 percent slag and 5 \
		percent natural pozzolan (judgment informed by USGS, DOE and RILEM \
		sources).
	|

