SoFSbI Share of Financing Support by Instrument[Financing Support Instrument]=
	GET DIRECT CONSTANTS(
	   'InputData/ctrl-settings/SoFSbI/SoFSbI.csv',
	   ',',
	   'B2*'
	)
	~	Dmnl
	~	Of the interest-rate reduction delivered by Perc Decrease in Cost of \
		Capital for Clean Industrial Equipment, the share delivered by each \
		instrument type.  Shares must sum to 1 (not enforced).  Deployment is \
		unaffected by this setting - the lever alone sets the rate reduction; \
		these shares set only the government cost and financial-sector incidence.  \
		Default is 100 percent pure derisking, which reproduces the model's \
		pre-instrument-accounting behavior exactly (zero fiscal cost) at any lever \
		value; costed instruments are a deliberate scenario opt-in.  See the About \
		tab of the source workbook in InputData/ctrl-settings/SoFSbI.
	|

