This Year Decrease in Process Emissions by Policy and Industry[cement and other nonmetallic minerals 239\
		,indst cement measures
,Pollutant]=
	0
	{RETIRED WITH THE CEMENT BREAKOUT (levers block, 2026-08-26). This
	branch was the DIRECT lever path of the legacy cement-measures MAC:
	PERAC avoidable mass x Fraction of Cement Measures Achieved This
	Year, bypassing the ALLOCATE machinery entirely. With the lever
	repurposed as the clinker-substitution lever it double-counted the
	module's mechanistic response (23 MMT CO2e at full lever, caught in
	the levers-block gate run) and fired against the non-cement RESIDUAL
	of 239's process ledger. Cement process-CO2 abatement now flows
	exclusively through the pathway module (clinker demand x CCF).
	Companion retirements: the carbon-tax branch of Process Emissions
	Abated due to Carbon Tax by Marginal Cost (Phase 2a) and the cement
	branch of Reduction Achieved by Marginal Cost (levers block). The
	Non BAU Process Emissions ADDITIONS channel for this element (BUNBPEA
	boolean + PEAAC-cement data) is separate, off by default, and left
