	  0,

	  This Year Pollutants Sequestered by Hydrogen Sector[Pollutant]
	  - Last Year Potential Pollutants Sequestered by Hydrogen Sector[Pollutant]
	)
	~	g pollutant
	~	New sequestration capacity purchased this year: the amount by which \
		required capture exceeds the peak capacity already installed. Mirrors the \
		industry sector treatment, so temporary dips in captured tonnage do not \
		trigger repurchasing equipment that already exists.
