Note that we use two sets of subsidies here. For CCUS plants, we use "Total Subsidies per Unit Electricity Output Adjusted for Lifetime" to reflect the potential impact of dispatch changes from these subsidies. In the future this should be handled upstream via a different dispatch mechanism for estimating market revenues.
